        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 15001, Restroom Door Throw Latch Bar and Keeper</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThrow latch door bar typically used on commercial restroom stall doors. Locks a lavatory door for privacy in a toilet area. Packaged with installation screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nConstructed of solid brass, this flip type door bar is surface mounted (screw to the doors face). Made in the USA.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Bommer 15001 Restroom Stall Door Latch and Keeper:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Wrought Brass</li>\r\n<li>Base Plate Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Plate Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bar Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bar Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bar Thickness: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bar Knob Total Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Keeper Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Keeper Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 8 each #8 x 3/4\" wood screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/15001.pdf?v=1691094994\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 15001 Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nComes packaged with latch bar and keeper. Set is for one (1) door.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** This item is discontinued. None available.</b>\r\n</p>",
